// Procedural music. Each piece is a seeded melody over a scale; the world seed
// and a play counter pick the piece and its notes. Long silences between
// pieces are intended. Moods: Day, Night, Underground, Combat.
// Scales are semitones above `root_hz`. `cargo test music_ron` checks the format.
